("10.2","Audit logs are implemented to support the detection of anomalies and suspicious activity, and forensic analysis","Se implantan registros de auditoria que permiten detectar anomalias y actividad sospechosa y realizar analisis forense"),
("10.3","Audit logs are protected from destruction and unauthorized modifications","Los registros de auditoria estan protegidos frente a destruccion y modificaciones no autorizadas"),
("10.4","Audit logs are reviewed to identify anomalies or suspicious activity","Los registros de auditoria se revisan para identificar anomalias o actividad sospechosa"),
("10.5","Audit log history is retained and available for analysis","El historico de registros de auditoria se conserva y esta disponible para su analisis"),
("10.6","Time-synchronization mechanisms support consistent time settings across all systems","Mecanismos de sincronizacion horaria garantizan una hora coherente en todos los sistemas"),
