("11.3","External and internal vulnerabilities are regularly identified, prioritized, and addressed","Las vulnerabilidades externas e internas se identifican, priorizan y tratan regularmente"),
("11.4","External and internal penetration testing is regularly performed, and exploitable weaknesses are corrected","Se realizan regularmente pruebas de penetracion externas e internas y se corrigen las debilidades explotables"),
