("11.6","Unauthorized changes on payment pages are detected and responded to","Los cambios no autorizados en las paginas de pago se detectan y se atienden"),
("12.1","A comprehensive information security policy that governs and provides direction for protection of information assets is known and current","Una politica integral de seguridad de la informacion que gobierna y orienta la proteccion de los activos es conocida y esta actualizada"),
("12.2","Acceptable use policies for end-user technologies are defined and implemented","Las politicas de uso aceptable de las tecnologias de usuario final estan definidas e implantadas"),
