("12.5","PCI DSS scope is documented and validated","El alcance de PCI DSS esta documentado y validado"),
("12.6","Security awareness education is an ongoing activity","La formacion en concienciacion de seguridad es una actividad continua"),
("12.7","Personnel are screened to reduce risks from insider threats","Se investiga al personal para reducir los riesgos de amenazas internas"),
("12.8","Risk to information assets associated with third-party service provider (TPSP) relationships is managed","Se gestiona el riesgo para los activos de informacion asociado a las relaciones con proveedores de servicios (TPSP)"),
("12.9","Third-party service providers (TPSPs) support their customers' PCI DSS compliance","Los proveedores de servicios (TPSP) respaldan el cumplimiento de PCI DSS de sus clientes"),
